# Amalia Benavides Aguirre: "Whenever you gain life, Amalia explores. Then destroy all other creatures if its power is exactly 20."
# Her power is built from: Wrecking Ball Arm's base 7/7 (layer 7b) + two +1/+1 counters from Drannith Ruins on turn 1 + one from
# the turn-1 explore (a nonland Ornithopter, left on top and drawn on turn 3) = 10 on turn 7; Legion Leadership doubles it to 20
# on turn 9. Zuran Orb's life gain then explores once more: the top card is a Plains, a land, so it goes to hand and Amalia gets
# no counter - her power is exactly 20 and every OTHER creature is destroyed together, Bot1's own Ornithopter and both of
# Bot2's included, while Amalia stays. The only earlier life gain (turn 1) made her power 5, and nothing was destroyed then
# (Bot2's Ornithopters are cast on turn 2 and are still there on turn 9 until this ability resolves).

